      "kserc_reasoning": "Accordingly, the Commission hereby approves depreciation of Rs.94.17 lakh for the year 2019-20, Rs. 96.59 for the year 2020-21 Rs. 75.50 lakh for the year 2021-22 and Rs. 75.43 lakh for the year 2022-23 as per the revised calculation as shown above."
    },
